    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the Beast.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Beast Is Yet To Come, a ferocious 3D action roguelike, take control of a towering Troll built for destruction. Survive against relentless hordes, navigate shifting battlefields shaped by dynamic weather, and master the primal art of combat through visceral \u201cpunch hell\u201d combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Devastation</strong> \u2013 Combine and evolve unique skills to create devastating chain attacks. No two runs \u2014 or punches \u2014 are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Combat</strong> \u2013 Face waves of foes in real-time, physics-heavy brawls where momentum, positioning, and brutality rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong> \u2013 Each map changes with unpredictable weather effects \u2014 fog, lightning storms, mudslides \u2014 affecting both you and your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo Crafting</strong> \u2013 Build your own \u201cpunch hell\u201d system using a flexible skill tree filled with brutal perks, elemental modifiers, and beast-fueled abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the hero. You are the storm.<br><strong>The Beast Is Yet To Come.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the Beast.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Beast Is Yet To Come, a ferocious 3D action roguelike, take control of a towering Troll built for destruction. Survive against relentless hordes, navigate shifting battlefields shaped by dynamic weather, and master the primal art of combat through visceral \u201cpunch hell\u201d combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Devastation</strong> \u2013 Combine and evolve unique skills to create devastating chain attacks. No two runs \u2014 or punches \u2014 are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Combat</strong> \u2013 Face waves of foes in real-time, physics-heavy brawls where momentum, positioning, and brutality rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong> \u2013 Each map changes with unpredictable weather effects \u2014 fog, lightning storms, mudslides \u2014 affecting both you and your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo Crafting</strong> \u2013 Build your own \u201cpunch hell\u201d system using a flexible skill tree filled with brutal perks, elemental modifiers, and beast-fueled abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the hero. You are the storm.<br><strong>The Beast Is Yet To Come.</strong></p>",
